  BigVGAN v2 vocoders (22 kHz, 44 kHz)        nvidia/bigvgan_v2_*                MIT
  Whisper small (content encoder)             openai/whisper-small               Apache-2.0
  BS-Roformer vocal separation, ep_317        by viperx, distributed with Ultimate Vocal
                                              Remover and python-audio-separator.
                                              THE AUTHOR HAS NOT PUBLISHED A LICENCE for
                                              this checkpoint. It is only needed when
                                              "keep_background" is on.
